From 255c912fb6dfee398939acec9c2d9f1638c09da4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tunkoal <tunkoal@163.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:13:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Face enrollment: supply HAL-owned preview without opening
 a second camera

Use queried sensor geometry and wait for a valid Surface. Keep the Surface and detached texture alive until a real terminal enrollment callback, isolate callback generations, and cancel attempts whose view is paused or destroyed. Preserve the existing framework camera preview for legacy sensors.

Requires the coordinated FaceSensorPropertiesInternal platform update. Validation: static review and diff checks; tests and build deferred to the combined four-feature candidate.

